      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BELIEVE IN BETTOR (3) finished second last start, beaten 2.25 metres at this track over 2185m. Talented and has plenty of upside. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Good enough to take out a race like this. MUFFIN LOSE (5) had been searching for an elusive win before finding some form at her latest appearance over 2130m at Gloucester Park, scoring by 25 metres after being close to the pace throughout. Meets a comparable field so she is capable of getting the job done again. FIRTH OF CLYDE (7) broke in the run and finished fourth, beaten 30 metres, first-up last time out over 2130m at Gloucester Park. Has to contend with a very wide draw. Won't find this any harder and he can bounce back. HIGHVIEW ROZI (2) has been about the mark of late and must be respected, the latest offering a sound fifth at this track over 2185m.",
